e,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":25807,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":5585,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["elasticsearch","java","search-engine"],"visibility":"public","forks":25807,"open_issues":5585,"watchers":76300,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/pulls/110268","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/110268","diff_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/110268.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/110268.patch","merged_at":"2024-07-02T10:19:09Z"},"body":"The `index.mode` setting validates other index settings. When updating the `index.time_series.end_time` setting and the `index.mode` setting isn't wasn't defined at index creation time (meaning that default is active), then this validation is skipped which results into (worse) errors at a later point in  time.\r\n\r\nThis problem is fixed by enforced by making `index.mode` setting a dependency of `index.time_series.end_time` setting.\r\n\r\nNote that this problem doesn't exist for the `index.time_series.start_time` and `index.routing_path` index settings, because these index settings are final, which mean these can only be defined when an index is being created. \r\n\r\nCloses #110265","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/110268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/110268/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":